  Frame -> True, FrameLabel -> {\"theta [deg]\", \"N\"},\n    PlotLabel -> \
\"Presion uniforme: N(theta)\", PlotRange -> All,\n    ImageSize -> Large\n  \
]\n}]"], "Input", CellTags -> {"Prototype1Run"}],
  Cell["Prototipo 2 \[LongDash] relleno estratificado y campo K0",
   "Section"], Cell["Ejemplo sint\[EAcute]tico completo: calcula las \
